      "value": "@{5f2cc9743e5e4b3102c1074e|full_name}: \nmy apologies, but i'm uncertain by what you mean, I followed what the VRChat article said about creating the .json file, and put it as follows:\n{\n    \"cache_directory\" : \"D:\\Users\\(user directory name here)\\AppData\\LocalLow\\VRChat\\VRChat\"\n}\nthis .json file resides in the main directory of the same general location on the C: drive\nIf this is incorrect, please let me know :o",
      "viewerReactions": null
