      "value": "@{5a0fbe8f7defe9247395df44|full_name}: That is incorrect as it's using backslash, not forward slash meaning it's \"invalid\" as you have escape characters in there. Windows doesn't care about the slash direction, however .json does.\nYour file path in the config file should look like this instead. Take note of the slash direction.\nD:/Users/(user directory name here)/AppData/LocalLow/VRChat/VRChat",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
